        <p>Schemes for the making of two ship canals aro under consideration in Belgium. It is proposed to make drupe a seaport by cutting a deep water canal from there to the sea at Eleyst, a few miles to the west of Ostend. The other scheme aims at connecting Brussels with thesea by • canal from the Scheldt, near Antwerp.</p>
