        <p>SHIP CANAL APPROXIMATE TRAFFIC RETURNS The following tahles show the increase in traffic on the Canal for the month of August., aq compared with August. 1894, and the increase in the first eight months of the year. as compared with the corresponding period of last year : August, 1895. A ngust,lB94. Tons. E Tons. E Bee-going traffic... 103 423 ... 11.115 71,112 ... 7,019 Barge traffic' 20,575 . 396 Pasowngersotc Rents rt son. rec.— 700</p>
