        <p>----- . _ BROOKLANDS. WARRINGTON. Moir Byr s run out 3 Adamson 00 F Terry 0 Hartley b Bibby 7 Bibby not out ' 28 H F Terry c Roddy b Brown b 0 P Terry 9 Crompton l7 Hampoon c Watson b 0 F Fry at 'lampoon b Bibby 0 Terry Davies b Silc,"ck C F Terry run out 1 Byres bebiele b Roddy Watson rim out A Terry c Aibinson b Ash- ton Harvey not out . 6 Carr b Bibby 0 Extras ll</p>
        <p>1xtra5......... 7</p>
        <p>Total ... 88 Total 73 EARLESTOWN T. LElGH.—Played at Earlestown on sat- =day, resulting in a draw. Score : LBlOll. EARLESTOWN. J W Turner c Aldersoa b Dennis.. Bunn b Hindley 0 Clare Bunn o Alderson b Clare W otewart b Glare W Hindley b Huddleston lB Bunn Jli Bolton b Alderson A T Fletcher c Nokes b T Barker b Parker Husband 2B F P Clare run out 3 Pass c Emmett b W Huddlestou c Fletcher Husband 0 b Parker 0 ,G T Hart o and c Alderson 4J H Aid rson not out lB ' w Parker o Miler b Clare 8 W H Crowther not out W Knowles not 0ut...... ...... 14 C W Emmett did not bat J Manson b Emmett 7 hztras l4</p>
        <p>Extra B 2</p>
        <p>Total 116 Total ll4 EARLESTOWN 2ND V. LEIGH 2ND.—Played at Leigh on Saturoay. Score :</p>
