      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-09-21_WidnesExaminer_art0113" n="art0113">
        <head>WHAT CAN CUTICURA DO FOR CHILDREN?</head>
        <p>WHAT CAN CUTICURA DO FOR CHILDREN?</p>
        <p>Everything that is cleansing, purifying, and beauti- fying for the skin, scalp, and hair of infants and chiI- dren,CUTICORA remedies will do. They afford instant relief, permit rest and sleep, and point to a speedy cure in the most torturing of itching and burning eczema&amp; They clear the skin of the most disfiguring of humours. They cleanse the, scalp of dandruff, scales, and crusts, and restore the hair. They purify the blood of simple, Scrofuloug, and hereditary humours. Everthing about them inspires confidence. They are absolutely pure and may be used from the moment of birth. They are speedy, economical, and unfailing. Parents, think of the lifetime of suffering often entail( d by lack of early treatment. Begin now. Cures made in childhood are almost invariably permanent.</p>
        <p>Tho Sankey Wire Mills C.C. brought their saason to a close on Saturday last. Having played 15 matches, wen 7, lost 6, drawn 2. The following have batted and bowled in not less than 5 innings.</p>
        <p>BITTING.</p>
