        <p>CYCLING. At the athletic sports in connection with Lower Peover which were held on Saturday, Mr. E. W. Charnock, of Warrington, carried off the second prize, valued at £l, in the one mile open bicycle race. W. Collin, of War- rington, was first in the third heat of the above race,but could not pull Gff a prize in the final. B. Newcombe. of Warrington, came in second in the twe miles open bicy- cle race, carrying off a priv valued at El 10s.</p>
